---
---

<section class="flagship section" id="flagship">
  <div class="flagship-shell">
    <div class="flagship-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562259929-b4e1fd3aef09?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80"
        alt=""
        width="1600"
        height="1100"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="flagship-content reveal">
      <p class="section-label">Flagship Spotlight</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Bi Paints — protecting what India builds</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        High-performance industrial and protective coatings for infrastructure,
        marine, energy, and demanding industrial environments.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Protective &amp; industrial coating systems</li>
        <li>Marine, container, and heavy-duty applications</li>
        <li>Color coating expertise for lasting finishes</li>
        <li>Backed by a major manufacturing expansion roadmap</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contact">Request a consultation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .flagship {
    padding: 0;
    background: var(--mist);
  }

  .flagship-shell {
    display: grid;
    min-height: min(78vh, 740px);
  }

  .flagship-media {
    min-height: 280px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .flagship-media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .flagship-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    background:
      linear-gradient(160deg, #ffffff 0%, #eef3fb 100%);
  }

  .flagship-content .section-title {
    max-width: 14ch;
  }

  ul {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }

  li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.55rem;
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    background: var(--gold);
  }

  @media (min-width: 920px) {
    .flagship-shell {
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
    }

    .flagship-media {
      min-height: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
